# Standard Git Attributes for Cross-Platform Line Ending Normalization (LF)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
